		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Aquamarine scales ripple down the hide of this finned, 50-foot-long dragon. Opinionated, power-hungry.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 salt breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Brineblood</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Salt Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) of desiccating brine, extending double near from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d6 damage and 1d8 STR damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
